@startuml AuthenticatedRequest

title Punchclock - Create Entry with JWT Authentication

actor User
participant Browser
participant JWTAuthentication
participant EntryController
participant EntryService
participant EntryRepository
database Database

User -> Browser : Create new time entry

Browser -> JWTAuthentication : POST /entries\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT\nEntryDto

JWTAuthentication -> JWTAuthentication : Verify JWT signature
JWTAuthentication -> JWTAuthentication : Check expiration and claims

alt JWT valid
    JWTAuthentication -> EntryController : Forward authenticated request

    EntryController -> EntryService : createEntry(entry)

    EntryService -> EntryRepository : persist(entry)

    EntryRepository -> Database : INSERT Entry
    Database --> EntryRepository : Saved Entry

    EntryRepository --> EntryService : Saved Entry
    EntryService --> EntryController : Created Entry

    EntryController --> Browser : 201 Created + EntryDto
    Browser --> User : Display saved Entry

else JWT missing, invalid or expired
    JWTAuthentication --> Browser : 401 Unauthorized
    Browser --> User : Redirect to login
end

@enduml